# Nothing goes to Docker but the two page folders and the server's settings.
# (Everything is left out first,  then those three are let back in.)
*
!DataPage/
!it-console/
!deploy/
deploy/*
!deploy/nginx.conf

# ...and never these,  wherever they are:  data,  packs,  key files,  keyrings.
**/*.flogic
**/*.flogic-key
**/*.flogic-keyring
**/*.flogic-signer
**/*.flogic-id
**/*.csv
**/*.xlsx
**/*.sql
**/*.db
**/*.zip
